    "title": "Live Me - Video Chat online",
    "description": "Live Me is a vibrant live video chat app designed to facilitate engaging and meaningful online social interactions. It's equipped with features like Video Calling, Video Matching, and Text Chat, enabling users to choose their preferred mode of communication and connection.\r\n\r\nExplore Our Features:\r\n\r\nInstant Live Video Match: Set your match preferences by region and type of people you want to meet. Swipe and quickly match with someone. You can add users you've matched with as friends for direct messaging or 1:1 Video Calls.\r\n\r\n1-on-1 Video Calls: Directly call friends or other online users for personal video chats. Enjoy sending gifts and experimenting with fun filters.\r\n\r\nReal-Time Translation: Language differences won't be a barrier. Our real-time translation feature ensures smooth live chats and easy friendships across the globe.\r\n\r\nVideo Filters & Beauty Effects: Use our advanced video filters and cute stickers to enhance your video chats.\r\n\r\nUnlimited Text Chat: Add users you meet on Live Me as friends and message them without limits. Keep conversations going when you're not able to connect via Video Calls.",
